<title>POLAND: STOMIL MARCH NET FALLS TO PLN 3.2 MLN.</title>
<headline>STOMIL MARCH NET FALLS TO PLN 3.2 MLN.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-04-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Preliminary results March </p>
<p>(in million zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p> MARCH		    1997     1996</p>
<p> Net profit	     3.20 vs   4.64</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	 5.25 vs   7.62</p>
<p> Operating profit     6.95 vs   6.69</p>
<p> Sales		   55.71 vs  51.13</p>
<p> JANUARY-MARCH	  1997     1996</p>
<p> Net profit	    15.22 vs  14.72</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	19.98 vs  25.35</p>
<p> Operating profit    22.00 vs  22.11</p>
<p> Sales		  161.23 vs 146.07</p>
<p>Note. Full name of the Polish tyre maker is Stomil Olsztyn SA.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
